  "question": {
    "text": "If p and q be the longest and the shortest distance respectively of the point $(-7,2)$ from any point $(\\alpha, \\beta)$ on the curve whose equation is $x^2+y^2-10 x-14 y-51=0$, then G.M. of p",
    "image": null
  },
